            "reviewer": {
                "name": "garybeihl",
                "email": "garybeihl@microsoft.com",
                "username": "garybeihl"
            },
            "message": "Patch Set 2:\n\nPatch Set 2:\n\nDeepak: Good question. This change is currently limited to fixing the path segment \u2014 PldmEntityReq still implements Inventory.Item.Board for all entity types. Adding entity-type-specific D-Bus interfaces (e.g. Inventory.Item.Gpu, Inventory.Item.Cpu) is the logical next step, but I kept it as a separate follow-up to keep this patch focused. Happy to add a TODO comment in the code if that helps."
        },
        {
            "timestamp": 1773334061,
            "reviewer": {
                "name": "garybeihl",
